===Other Unused Units===
Looking through the CVS files for The Battle Cats Unite! shows that there were multiple units that were cut from the game. There are unused stats for units ranging from [[Version 1.0 Update|Version 1.0]] to [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] implying that the game must have been developed in a 9 month period. Over 200 units, including Advents, Gacha, and Collaboration cats were cut from the game but their XP tables and slots for their Cat Dictionary slots still remain.

==Unused Unit Stats==
A couple of units have had their stats seemingly changed throughout development as well as a different unit IDs. Two cats of notice seem to be Driller Cat and Piledriver Cat. Located in the game's files shows old stats that go completely unused as well as IDs that are completely different than what is currently being used in the game itself. Driller Cat initially had an ID of 400 (now 384) and Piledriver Cat initially had an ID of 401 (now 386).
